WHAT STANDS AND WHAT DOES NOT
  STANDS.  The headline -- three, forced by boron, lanthanum and lawrencium,
    with Gallai duality exact -- reproduces in the node-only form under BOTH
    candidate sets, witnesses and all.  La's endpoints reproduce to the digit
    in all four cells.  And 1517's split of the 106 is right on two of its
    three numbers at l <= 4 node-only: 26 above-only exactly, and 80 carrying
    a lower bound exactly.
  DOES NOT.  1517 leaves SEVEN of those eighty open above; measured, three --
    in every one of the four cells.  And it closes lawrencium's corridor at
    2.4409, where it is open above in every cell; that value is not an endpoint
    anywhere in the family.  The finished form gives four disjoint corridors,
    not three, and the entry named no form.
  NOT ATTEMPTED.  No search was made for a fifth convention under which
    73 / 7 / 26 / 0 would fall out.  Six were tried -- two forms by two
    candidate sets, and the Z window shifted -- and below-only is 3 in all six.
    A convention reverse-engineered to fit a figure is not a reproduction.
RECORDED, NOT REPAIRED.
